WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.067
Tensions are rising

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.401
in one of

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.802
the most hotly contested

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.104
regions on the planet,

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:05.672
the South China Sea,

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.539
from militarized

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.675
artificial islands to fighter jets

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.576
and warplanes.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:10.143
China's

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.611
heavy presence in the disputed

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:13.013
region is putting the US

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.781
and its allies on notice.

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.916
CNN got rare access aboard a U.S.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:17.851
Navy surveillance

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:18.451
flight

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.452
and saw firsthand

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:21.721
some tense moments with China's military.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:25.358
Here's CNN's Ivan Watson.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.060
This is a close encounter

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.862
with a Chinese warplane

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.930
filmed just off the wing of a U.S.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.998
Navy reconnaissance

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.634
plane flying over the South China Sea.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.002
We're getting a close up

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.605
look at a Chinese fighter jet.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.306
The air crew here identifies it

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.174
as a shell.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.309
11, a two seater that they say

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:46.112
is armed with air to air missiles.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.848
And it's been shadowing this U.S.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.217
Navy, playing now for about 15 minutes.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:54.220
It is pretty remarkable

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:57.390
to see this Chinese warplane operating

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.727
at such close proximity

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.896
just several hundred feet away

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.165
from our aircraft.

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.366
I don't know how

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.200
the Chinese fighter

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.602
escort part of a regular routine.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.472
I'd say it's another Friday afternoon

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.641
in the South China Sea. The U.S.

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:15.442
Navy invited

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:18.178
CNN to fly on a P-8 reconnaissance plane

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.546
taking off from a U.S.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:20.814
air base on the Japanese

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:22.082
island of Okinawa

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.551
at 300 on September six.

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:25.752
Along the way,

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:26.920
picking up fuel

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.622
from a flying gas station.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.124
We're refueling in midair

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:34.461
right now, flying just about 40 feet away

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.897
from a KC one 35 tanker plane.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:39.566
The plane

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:40.266
is headed past

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.602
the self-governing island of Taiwan,

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.704
which China claims as its own,

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:47.340
to the South China Sea, which China

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:49.943
also claims almost all for itself,

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.311
ignoring competing

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:53.346
claims from countries like Vietnam

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:55.415
and the Philippines.

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:57.584
Some 30 miles from the Chinese occupied

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:59.119
Paracel Islands.

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:01.855
A Chinese voice crackles over the radio.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:03.623
American aircraft

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.925
they think of the Air Force.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.527
You are approaching Chinese,

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.562
offering a safe distance.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.333
In fact, that's when the Chinese people's

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.135
Liberation Army fighter jet

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.302
appears flying

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.237
so close

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:19.706
you can see the pilots in their cockpit,

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.942
a fighter aircraft, and then

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.612
on one, two, one, four, five,

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.013
I I'll drop my left

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.915
wing and I will continue to proceed

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:30.116
to the west.

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:32.252
The Chinese pilot never responds,

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:34.454
but eventually leaves when the U.S.

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.623
plane turns south. And

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.926
its like oil spots as they build

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:41.194
as they build on one reef

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.662
and then build on another

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:43.863
Commodore will tourists

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.499
and shows the network of manmade islands

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:47.400
China built

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.502
on what had been coral reefs

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:51.638
claimed by other countries.

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:53.273
Our number one focus here

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:53.940
is to ensure

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.476
that we have continued access

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.245
alongside all of our allies and partners

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.347
to international airspace

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.082
and international waters.

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:03.550
The U.S.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.217
presence here

00:03:04.217 --> 00:03:06.819
aimed at preventing further encroachment

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.288
by China experts.

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:09.422
The captain knows

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.957
we're flying at a low altitude,

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.158
a thousand feet,

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.993
a little more than 300 meters

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:17.163
above sea level east of Taiwan.

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:19.999
Looking for a Chinese warship

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:22.535
currently believed to be operating

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:24.938
in these stormy waters.

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:25.872
The plane spots

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.874
