I'm a

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:37.150
United States

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.619
military aircraft and our marionette,

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:41.988
a cat and mouse game

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:44.090
between two rival militaries

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:45.425
in one of the most

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:48.261
hotly contested regions in the world.

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.463
